                <path d="M118 145 v-44 h28 v44" />
              </svg>
              <div>
                <h3>Governance, corruption, and institutional power</h3>
                <p>
                  Anti-corruption reform, public services, state capacity, opacity, and the
                  historical sociology of governance.
                </p>
              </div>
              <span class="cluster-link">View cluster →</span>
            </a>
            <a class="cluster-card" href="/research/#classification" aria-label="View inequality, classification, and recognition research cluster">
