              </svg>
              <div>
                <h3>Inequality, classification, and recognition</h3>
                <p>
                  Race, Indigeneity, identity categories, social vulnerability, and the politics of
                  classification.
                </p>
              </div>
              <span class="cluster-link">View cluster →</span>
            </a>
            <a class="cluster-card" href="/research/#technology" aria-label="View technology, AI, and sociotechnical governance research cluster">
              <span class="cluster-number">03</span>
              <svg class="cluster-motif" viewBox="0 0 260 180" aria-hidden="true">
